      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't think it's just resting though. it doesn't feel like a field waiting for spring. it feels like the well actually ran dry. like the part of me that actually mattered is just... gone. and if that's gone, what am i even supposed to do with the rest of this? just keep existing as a shell? it feels pointless.",
